      "side": 1,
      "message": "Unlikely. The `tablet_mode_disable_power_button` hook primarily handles the case where you long-press the power button to switch to tablet mode. At this point, `power_button_interrupt` is disabled, so it can\u0027t be handled in `raw_power_button_pressed` . In this case, we need to clear `debounced_power_pressed` . Otherwise, if you release the power button in tablet mode and switch back to clamshell mode, the first press of the power button will have no effect.",
      "parentUuid": "0d4a0e54_33185bc2",
      "revId": "5f5816b2e51f1fc09c8ae85be39e729f81483f6d",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
